WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:21.990
My adrenaline's always flowin'

2
00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:28.510
so it feels like I'll overheat

3
00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:32.850
Even if I explode and turn to ashes

4
00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:39.590
I'll probably still be laughing
Just like this

5
00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:45.120
Blowing past the town
To the ends of the world

6
00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:50.600
Let's burn rubber
And die together like lovers

7
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:55.430
Let's cut loose
Until we reach our limit

8
00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:00.470
so we can reach the horizon

9
00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:04.940
Crash
 Into the rolling morning

10
00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:08.580
Flash
I'm in the coolest driver's high

11
00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:13.920
Toward the finish line

12
00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:42.410
Holy Forest Academy

13
00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:42.410
What? Not here?
He hasn't come yet?

14
00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:45.350
He left so early this morning!

15
00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:48.590
If he's not just running late,
I wonder what happened.

16
00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:50.850
The exam is about to begin.

17
00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:53.060
Mr. Onizuka...

18
00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:06.410
Oh, crap. I'm so unlucky.

19
00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:09.160
When I don't have
much time to spare...

20
00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:10.890
...I witness a kidnapping!

21
00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:15.030
Boss, that paper delivery guy's
still following us.

22
00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:17.450
He's so persistent!

23
00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:23.990
Help... please...

24
00:02:32.350 --> 00:02:33.810
What are we gonna do?

25
00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:36.140
He's like an annoying fly.

26
00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:38.100
Smash him dead
before it's too late!

27
00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:39.010
Yes, sir.

28
00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:51.900
You've done a horrible thing!
Murderers! No!

29
00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.850
Oh, poor thing.
Well, let's go.

30
00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:06.660
1st Period Japanese

31
00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:12.100
For Onizuka Only

32
00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:13.900
He's not here yet.

33
00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:16.680
What is he doing,
that Onizuka fellow?

34
00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:19.570
If he doesn't score
the highest on this exam...

35
00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:22.080
...he's gonna get fired on the spot.
Doesn't he know that?

36
00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:25.830
Hey, it's exam time.
Be quiet!

37
00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:27.010
Mr. Onizuka...

38
00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:31.920
Faculty Room

39
00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:38.300
I really admire you,
Mr. Teshigawara.

40
00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:40.000
You're a graduate
of Tokyo University...

41
00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.200
...and you still have
a humble enough spirit...

42
00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.100
...to take a Junior level exam.

43
00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.310
I also wanted to make sure
there are no errors in the questions.

44
00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:49.610
Whoa, wonderful.

45
00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:54.120
On the contrary, that guy
seems to have run away.

46
00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.500
Well, I guess
that's probably wiser...

47
00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.470
...than making a big fool
of himself nationwide...

48
00:03:58.470 --> 00:03:59.930
...by scoring lowest
on the exam.

49
00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:06.320
Come on! What in the world
happened, Mr. Onizuka?

50
00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:14.430
That's right. Gently...

51
00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:16.730
...cut up her clothes.

52
00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.640
Are you too scared
to talk, young lady?

53
00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.960
Don't worry.

54
00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:25.960
Your daddy, the assemblyman,
treasures you.

55
00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:28.110
Keep quiet
and you won't get hurt.

56
00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:33.600
This is a request to get your daddy
to do a little favor in his field.

57
00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:37.350
That's all there is to it.

58
00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:39.960
Hey, bring the video camera.

59
00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:43.620
Oh, it's easy.

60
00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:46.890
You just ask your daddy
to do us a favor.

61
00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.330
Use a little sex appeal.

62
00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:51.000
When he sees you
in the tape...

63
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.500
...I'm sure
he will cooperate with us.

64
00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.460
If you want to go home safely...

65
00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:59.700
...I suggest you do
what I've told you to.

66
00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:06.090
Well, our young friends are
a little rough and impatient.

67
00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:07.770
They give me a headache.

68
00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:09.180
Hey, hurry up
and bring the video camera!

69
00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:14.260
Umm. It's nice.

70
00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:17.220
I wonder if X-rated videos
are shot like this.

71
00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:19.660
Well, spread your legs more...

72
00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:22.930
However, due to my
vocational obligation...

73
00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:25.400
...I can't let such a thing
go on like this.

74
00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.470
What are you mumbling about?

75
00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:34.340
Ouch, ow... shit.

76
00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:38.700
Hey, come on, let's get it over with.
Sorry, but I'm in a bit of a hurry.

77
00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:41.880
I'm supposed to be in the middle
of taking a national exam.

78
00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.070
Whoa, my nose...

79
00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:48.630
Who the hell are you?
Are you trying to stop us? Huh?

80
00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:51.940
Which gang sent you? Bastard!

81
00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:52.890
Gang?

82
00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.260
Whoa!

83
00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:03.200
I'm with Class 3-4!
You dummy!

84
00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:07.370
Ah... sorry!

85
00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:10.340
Please continue.
Never mind...

86
00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:16.460
What happened?

87
00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:20.250
Please, please hurry...
hurry and show up, Mr. Onizuka!

88
00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:29.090
It's appalling! A supposedly
mature, middle-aged man...

89
00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:31.500
...kidnaps a female student
and shoots a video?

90
00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:33.790
Don't you have any morals?

91
00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:37.160
What kind of mumbo-jumbo are
you talking about, you bastard?!

92
00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:41.210
Well, I rent "uniform tapes"
now and then...

93
00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:42.650
...but if those videos
are made like this...

94
00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:44.230
...forcing kidnapped
girls to pose...

95
00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:46.420
Wow!

96
00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:52.480
...as a humble teacher...

97
00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.950
...I wouldn't be able
to enjoy them anymore!

98
00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:57.720
Here! This is a lesson
you won't forget!

99
00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:00.220
On behalf
of the Ministry of Education...

100
00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:03.320
Phew...

101
00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:05.540
...I can't believe it! What do
those guys think they're doing?

102
00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:08.150
Hey, are you hurt anywhere?

103
00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:11.480
Behind you...

104
00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:15.810
This is not child's play,
all right, teacher?

105
00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:18.570
If you want to play your game,
do it in the afterlife.

106
00:07:19.340 --> 00:07:22.250
We're doing this without permission
from our boss...

107
00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:25.310
...and we're risking our lives, too.
So, we can't afford to stop now...

108
00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:29.480
Sorry, but we need you
to disappear!

109
00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.970
Then, good-bye.

110
00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:47.980
One more period left.

111
00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:51.690
Don't tell me Onizuka will get fired
without even taking the exam.

112
00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:54.590
It'll work out.
He'll show up.

113
00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:56.840
I'm sure he will... definitely!

114
00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:59.530
Hmm... What will he do,
even if he does show up?

115
00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:03.410
It's impossible to answer every question
in all subjects in an hour.

116
00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:07.820
Now, everyone,
please be seated.

117
00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:11.370
Miss Fuyutsuki,
what is Onizuka doing?

118
00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.380
Why hasn't he shown up?

119
00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.330
Miss Fuyutsuki!

120
00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.440
That's right!
Where is he?

121
00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:17.910
What happened?

122
00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:20.100
You studied so hard...
nevertheless...

123
00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:22.500
Be quiet!

124
00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:24.140
Vice Principal!

125
00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:26.460
If he's not here,
he's not here!

126
00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.970
That guy gave up on the exam!

127
00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:34.860
Now he will definitely get fired!
Ha ha ha... hah?

128
00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:46.950
Whoa! Mr. Onizuka!

129
00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:48.830
Mr. Onizuka!

130
00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.350
Whoa! It's Onizuka!

131
00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:54.000
Whoa! He showed up!
Gosh! We knew it!

132
00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:55.460
Sensei...

133
00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:02.790
Vice Principal,
sorry to bother you...

134
00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:06.040
...but could you take her
to the infirmary?

135
00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:08.380
Hey, who is she?

136
00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.970
Now, give me the exam papers,
Miss Fuyutsuki.

137
00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:14.950
I don't have much time.

138
00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:18.420
I need a perfect score
in all five subjects, right?

139
00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:21.520
Yes! I'll go get the exam papers
in the other subjects, too.

140
00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:26.420
Now, please start
working on the last subject.

141
00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.720
We're currently investigating
the crime scene...

142
00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:30.750
...in an abandoned building
at Naka-machi block...

143
00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:31.730
...in Musashino City.

144
00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:35.250
There seems to be several
critically injured people.

145
00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:40.340
Please send ambulances
right away. I repeat...

146
00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:47.820
Good luck.

147
00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.650
School Infirmary

148
00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:53.650
Oh, my goodness! Phew.

149
00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:56.560
Who is she?

150
00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:57.940
I wonder if that bastard Onizuka
was doing...

151
00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:00.480
...something indecent
to this girl...

152
00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:02.580
Huh? Whoa!

153
00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:06.590
Whoa! What is it?
What the hell is this?

154
00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.340
Umm, umm...

155
00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:11.690
Hmm... it doesn't look
like my own blood...

156
00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:14.040
Where is he?
Mr. Onizuka!

157
00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:16.620
In the middle of taking an exam.

158
00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.980
But how in the world...

159
00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.880
Hurry!
Take Mr. Onizuka to a hospital!

160
00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:22.790
Take Mr. Onizuka?

161
00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:26.820
He got shot... with a pistol...
Three times!

162
00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:30.860
Is that so?
A pistol... what?

163
00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.060
O.K. That's it!

164
00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:38.050
Finished! Done!
Ooh... we're free!

165
00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:39.820
All right. The person
at the end of each row...

166
00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:40.960
...please collect
the answer sheets.

167
00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:46.810
Miss Fuyutsuki.

168
00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:48.600
Thanks, Kikuchi.

169
00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:54.660
Wow, Mr. Onizuka answered
every question!

170
00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:58.410
All five subjects!
In only an hour! Amazing!

171
00:10:58.410 --> 00:10:59.520
Is it true?

172
00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:06.420
Studying so hard
really paid off, didn't it?

173
00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:09.490
Come on. Please wake up.
Mr. Oni...

174
00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.820
Mr. Onizuka!

175
00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:29.280
Operating Room

176
00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:36.520
Mr. Onizuka...

177
00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:51.980
Chairman...

178
00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:54.120
You look very tired.

179
00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:59.140
Why don't you go home?
I'll stay here in your place.

180
00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:00.490
But...

181
00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:02.360
He'll be fine.

182
00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:05.840
No matter what...
because Mr. Onizuka is...

183
00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:08.500
...the "immortal hero"
of our school.

184
00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:09.050
Operating Room

185
00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:10.790
Isn't it true?

186
00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:15.910
Chairman...

187
00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:20.450
Come on.
Cheer up and stand tall.

188
00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:22.230
The most crucial moment
has yet to come...

189
00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:24.630
...for Mr. Onizuka,
as well as for us.

190
00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:30.670
Attention: Concerned Press

191
00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:32.750
What a fool...

192
00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:35.660
He found a way
to get fired on his own.

193
00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:38.680
I didn't even have
to take the test.

194
00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:42.790
But I will press harder,
Mr. Onizuka!

195
00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:48.540
Even if you live, I'll make sure
you won't be able to survive socially.

196
00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.110
Please give us a comment...

197
00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.750
...on this case
from the school's standpoint.

198
00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.780
What kind of teacher
is Mr. Onizuka?

199
00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:04.660
Could you confirm the rumor
that he is involved with Mafia gangs?

200
00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:06.210
Aren't there unsettled feelings
among students?

201
00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:09.020
How is the school
going to deal with this?

202
00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:15.980
Look at that media crowd!
What has Onizuka done?

203
00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:19.300
This is why we should have
fired him immediately!

204
00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.390
What are we going to do,
Chairman?!

205
00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:25.090
TEACHER HAS
YAKUZA CONNECTION

206
00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:25.090
Calm down, Vice Principal.

207
00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:27.550
How can I calm down?

208
00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:31.650
It's the wildest scandal
in the history of our school!

209
00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:35.720
Even I can't believe that
Mr. Onizuka was involved...

210
00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:37.320
...in Enjo Kosai
and drug dealing.

211
00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:39.990
It's hard to believe
he would sink so low...

212
00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:41.310
Oh, my God!

213
00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:43.010
That's not true.

214
00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:45.440
But they said so
on the morning TV news...

215
00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:48.510
But the police have not released
any information...

216
00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.690
...on the cause of the case!

217
00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:51.810
Besides...

218
00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:56.500
...Mr. Onizuka is in the middle
of fighting for his life.

219
00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.420
You guys are too cruel!

220
00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:02.890
Anyway, it is a big problem
for our school!

221
00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:12.040
Huh? Ah, is that...
Could they be...?

222
00:14:15.590 --> 00:14:17.680
Assemblyman Ohta and Mrs. Ohta,
the representative...

223
00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:20.900
...of "The Society of the Study
of Victimization in Education."

224
00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:24.780
Hee! Those two have come
to our school!

225
00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:28.910
Hee! It's all over!
Our school will be shut down!

226
00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.800
If I lose my job...

227
00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.350
Now, fighting with our back
against the wall, Chairman...

228
00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:36.080
...please leave it to me.

229
00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:39.250
Oh, I wouldn't be able to assume
the role of Vice Principal...

230
00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:41.860
...if I couldn't take on
a mere assemblyman or two.

231
00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:45.940
I will take him on...
fair and square!

232
00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:54.870
Please let me beg
for your forgiveness!

233
00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:56.960
A part-time teacher here
did something so scandalous...

234
00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:58.770
...to disturb the public peace.

235
00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:01.250
I apologize...
sincerely... Please!

236
00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:04.450
Chairman, where is Mr. Onizuka?

237
00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:05.920
Um... that's...

238
00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.290
Speaking of that man...

239
00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:12.000
...to tell you the truth,
we fired him as of yesterday.

240
00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.450
Therefore, sorry to say...

241
00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:17.070
...our school has nothing
to do with him... technically...

242
00:15:17.070 --> 00:15:18.280
Vice Principal!

243
00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:19.570
Would you be quiet?

244
00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:20.880
Chairman!

245
00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:22.560
Hee!

246
00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:27.710
Hee! It's all over!

247
00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:32.210
Chairman! We were touched.

248
00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:34.520
He is truly dedicated!

249
00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:35.450
What?

250
00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:38.150
Our daughter told us
what happened.

251
00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:43.840
An unforgivable fellow kidnapped
my daughter in order to blackmail me...

252
00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:47.420
...regarding the public construction
bidding I'm in charge of.

253
00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.590
Mr. Onizuka rescued Hidemi...

254
00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:54.940
...risking the exam he was
about to take and even his own life!

255
00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:58.390
Please tell Mr. Onizuka that...

256
00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:01.490
...I am grateful to him
from the bottom of my heart...

257
00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:05.400
...and apologize for my wife's
past rude behavior.

258
00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:09.980
Please reverse the decision
to fire Mr. Onizuka.

259
00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.120
I beg of you.

260
00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:16.080
But we can't really ignore
the result of the national exam.

261
00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:19.290
I'm pretty positive that
he didn't score too well...

262
00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:22.760
The results are in!

263
00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:24.420
The breaking news on the results
of the national exam...

264
00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:25.200
...have just been released!

265
00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:27.430
How did Mr. Onizuka do?

266
00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:30.100
Um... it's...

267
00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:37.540
#3 Suguru Teshigawara

268
00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:40.750
#2 Yoshito Kikuchi

269
00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:44.330
#1 Eikichi Onizuka

270
00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:48.900
Perfect score?

271
00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:51.020
You mean...
that good-for-nothing bastard?

272
00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:52.760
Chairman!

273
00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:57.680
Eikichi Onizuka
No Visitors Allowed

274
00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:59.480
Mr. Onizuka...?

275
00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:06.140
Kichijoji Hospital

276
00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:06.140
Doctor! Mr. Onizuka escaped!

277
00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:10.820
Gyoza 
Miso Ramen 
Shio Ramen

278
00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:11.110
According to police, Mr. Onizuka was
the prime suspect in the criminal case...

279
00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:15.240
...in which over a dozen were injured.
However, it appears he was the one...

280
00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:18.150
...who rescued the daughter of
an assemblyman who was targeted...

281
00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:20.520
...for his involvement
in public construction bidding.

282
00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:22.480
During the incident, Mr. Onizuka
was shot three times...

283
00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:23.280
Hey, old man!

284
00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:23.620
...and was 
critically injured.

285
00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:28.610
RAMEN KING
Chinese Noodles

286
00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:24.740
Give me another bowl of rice
with an extra scoop on top.

287
00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:27.090
He has been in the hospital
fighting for his life...

288
00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:27.090
And add liver and gyoza.

289
00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:31.460
It was you, Kikuchi, wasn't it?

290
00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:35.030
I certainly prepared
two answer sheets...

291
00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:36.890
...and switched one
with Onizuka's sheet...

292
00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:38.400
...when I was collecting them.

293
00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:41.370
But... to tell you the truth...
it's a little strange...

294
00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:42.280
What?

295
00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:47.550
His answer sheet had one extra
correct answer with two points.

296
00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:53.780
Since my total score was 492,
his total should have been 494.

297
00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:56.150
But he got a perfect score.

298
00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:58.250
What does that mean?

299
00:17:58.250 --> 00:18:00.890
It means there are people
other than us...

300
00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:04.260
...who want him
to remain a teacher.

301
00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:06.630
It was your doing,
wasn't it, Chairman?

302
00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:09.630
You even made an arrangement...

303
00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:11.590
...with the board to let
that man score perfectly.

304
00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:14.200
What a dishonest act!

305
00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:18.750
No matter how much I'm criticized,
I won't regret it.

306
00:18:19.170 --> 00:18:23.240
That's how much
this school needs him.

307
00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:26.020
We need a teacher
like him desperately...

308
00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:27.880
Congratulations
#1 in Japan

309
00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:31.280
Hurray, Onizuka. Cool!
Awesome!

310
00:18:31.280 --> 00:18:33.520
Well, well, well...

311
00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:37.490
Though I got a perfect score
and finished at the top nationally...

312
00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:40.120
...the exam was
no more than junior high level.

313
00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:42.360
I would say... if a teacher
didn't score perfectly...

314
00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:46.170
...THAT would be a shame!
Ha ha ha...

315
00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:49.840
Why... why... why... why?

316
00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:54.310
Mr... Mr. Teshigawara!

317
00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:57.280
Ah, there you are!

318
00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:01.680
Huh... you live
in a place like this?

319
00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:03.620
Oh, it's you.

320
00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:04.950
Hey, that's rude!

321
00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:13.530
I wish I could go back
and be a junior high student...

322
00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:16.430
...and be in Class 3-4
in this school...

323
00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:21.950
Huh? What about Class 3-4?

324
00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:24.020
Um... nothing!

325
00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:27.640
If you don't have anything specific
to say, hurry up and go home.

326
00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:29.580
Your dad and mom
must be worried.

327
00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:32.150
You don't need to tell me
to go home!

328
00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:35.080
I can't stay in such
a filthy place too long!

329
00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:42.290
What the hell
is that girl thinking?

330
00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:49.210
Onizuka... Eikichi...

331
00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:08.920
I wonder
what his real score was.

332
00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:11.750
Justice

333
00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:20.890
This is...

334
00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:25.530
Onizuka!

335
00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:28.740
Kikuchi! Come to school
for a little while!

336
00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:30.700
The most terrible
thing happened!

337
00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:36.580
What's the most
terrible thing?

338
00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:39.450
I wanted to see some girls
on the Internet...

339
00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:41.030
...but the computer broke.

340
00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:45.350
You're the only one who can fix it.
So, please!

341
00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:49.120
I led such a stoic life
at Miss Fuyutsuki's for a week!

342
00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:53.480
So I'm starving
for that kind of stuff.

343
00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:55.960
Hey, teacher!

344
00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:56.770
Huh?

345
00:20:57.300 --> 00:20:59.330
About the national exam...

346
00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:02.440
...what did you think your score
would be realistically?

347
00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:05.450
Huh? It was obvious!

348
00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:06.040
What?

349
00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:08.240
Perfect score!

350
00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:13.810
Indeed... what an admirable
guy you are!

351
00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:15.910
What?
Did you say something?

352
00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:18.520
Why are you
in your underwear?

353
00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:21.150
I'm doing laundry after letting
it pile up for a long time.

354
00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:24.510
So I have nothing else to wear.
It's better than being naked!

355
00:21:44.090 --> 00:21:48.330
You and me, let's go away

356
00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:53.580
To look for new emotions today

357
00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:58.590
Together we can overcome

358
00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:04.530
Because I want to enjoy
A new tomorrow

359
00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:08.930
Open your eyes and open the door

360
00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:14.140
The world in front of your eyes

361
00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:19.740
I want to go out
With my favorite sounds

362
00:22:20.090 --> 00:22:24.350
I will taste
my childhood emotions

363
00:22:25.560 --> 00:22:35.150
I'm here to enjoy the sunlight

364
00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:45.160
I'm enjoying myself
More than in the past

365
00:22:45.310 --> 00:22:49.570
I want to see you, but I can't

366
00:22:49.780 --> 00:22:54.640
so I just embrace my love

367
00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:59.750
Even walking on a crowded street

368
00:22:59.960 --> 00:23:06.390
Your smile makes my head spin

369
00:23:16.930 --> 00:23:23.220
Next Episode

370
00:23:20.390 --> 00:23:21.130
Yoo-hoo!

371
00:23:21.800 --> 00:23:22.890
Kanzaki!

372
00:23:22.890 --> 00:23:23.770
It's obvious.

373
00:23:23.990 --> 00:23:25.640
Whoa!

374
00:23:27.520 --> 00:23:28.890
What are you plotting?

375
00:23:29.480 --> 00:23:31.940
It looks like I'll be able
to kill some time soon.
